# Supply-chain hardening: only install dependency versions that have been
# published for at least 7 days. A freshly-published compromised release won't
# be pulled in immediately, giving time for it to be caught and unpublished.
# Unit is days; requires npm >= 11.x. Applies at resolution time (npm install /
# npm update). npm ci is unaffected — it installs the exact locked versions.
min-release-age=7
